/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 280 Tm
(A new patient should arrive 15 minutes early. Ask them to bring photo identification, a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 265 Tm
(health card, and any dental insurance card. The first visit is an exam and any x-rays the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 250 Tm
(dentist needs. A cleaning is a separate visit unless the dentist has time the same day.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 229 Tm
(On the phone, welcome the caller to Maple Grove, confirm the address, ask which dentist) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 214 Tm
(they prefer, and ask whether they have dental insurance. Do not promise that a plan will) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 199 Tm
(pay for the visit.) Tj
