/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 147 Tm
(Please give at least 48 hours' notice to cancel or move an appointment. A cancellation) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 132 Tm
(with less than 48 hours' notice, or a missed visit, may be charged a $75 fee. The fee is) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 117 Tm
(waived the first time for a new patient. It is also waived when the patient is ill or when) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 102 Tm
(the weather is severe. Saturday visits use the same 48 hour rule.) Tj
