(A patient who arrives more than 15 minutes late may be asked to rebook. If the chair is) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 654 Tm
(still free, the visit can continue as a shorter appointment. Do not start a long procedure) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 639 Tm
(when it would delay the next patient by more than 10 minutes.) Tj
