1 0 0 1 54 610 Tm
(Insurance and payment) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 587 Tm
(The clinic can send claims directly to many Canadian dental plans. The patient pays the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 572 Tm
(unpaid part on the day of the visit. Maple Grove accepts debit, Visa, Mastercard, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 557 Tm
(cash. The clinic does not offer in-house financing. A written estimate can be sent to the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 542 Tm
(plan before a crown, root canal, or implant.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 521 Tm
(Do not say a service is fully covered. Say: we will send the claim, the plan decides the) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 506 Tm
(covered amount, and any balance is due at the visit. If the patient has no insurance, give) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 491 Tm
(the sample fee and say the dentist confirms it after the exam.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 462 Tm
(Sample fees) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 439 Tm
(Adult recall exam and cleaning: $220. Child recall exam and cleaning: $160. New patient) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 424 Tm
(exam with routine x-rays: $285. Emergency exam: $150, and treatment is extra. Take-home) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 409 Tm
(whitening kit: $399. In-office whitening: $550. Implant consultation: no charge. Implant) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 394 Tm
(treatment is quoted after the exam.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 373 Tm
(A second cleaning in the same year, or gum treatment, is quoted separately. Fluoride for a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 358 Tm
(child is included in the child recall fee. Whitening is cosmetic and is usually not) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 343 Tm
(covered by insurance.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 314 Tm
(Services) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 291 Tm
(The clinic provides exams, cleanings, fillings, crowns, root canals, simple extractions,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 276 Tm
(whitening, and implant consultations. Braces are not provided. Callers who ask about) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 261 Tm
(braces are referred to an orthodontist. Wisdom teeth that look complicated are referred to) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 246 Tm
(an oral surgeon. Dr. Wong removes straightforward teeth in the clinic.) Tj
/F2 13 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 217 Tm
(Emergencies and after hours) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 194 Tm
(During open hours, offer a same-day emergency exam with Dr. Michael Wong when he is in, or) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 179 Tm
(with the first open dentist. Ask about swelling, bleeding, a broken tooth, or pain that) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 164 Tm
(keeps the patient from sleeping. Swelling of the face or trouble breathing is urgent. Tell) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 149 Tm
(that caller to go to the nearest emergency department and not to wait for a dental chair.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 128 Tm
(After hours, the phone message says the clinic is closed and gives the on-call) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 113 Tm
(instructions. Follow the emergency policy and offer \(905\) 555-0148. Heavy bleeding, a) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 98 Tm
(knocked-out adult tooth, or an injury to the face should go to the emergency department) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 83 Tm
(when the clinic is closed.) Tj
