(How do I book a cleaning? Call \(905\) 555-0148. Adult recall visits are usually every six) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 721 Tm
(months. Some patients are asked to return every three or four months.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 700 Tm
(Do you take new patients? Yes. The first visit is an exam with Dr. Sarah Chen, Dr. Amrit) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 685 Tm
(Bhandal, or Dr. Michael Wong. Bring identification and any insurance card.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 664 Tm
(What is the cancellation policy? Give 48 hours' notice. Less notice, or a missed visit,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 649 Tm
(may cost $75. The first late cancellation for a new patient is waived. Illness and severe) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 634 Tm
(weather are waived.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 613 Tm
(Do you bill insurance directly? Often yes. The patient pays the unpaid part at the visit.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 598 Tm
(The plan, not the clinic, decides the covered amount.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 577 Tm
(How much is a cleaning? The sample adult recall fee is $220. The sample child recall fee) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 562 Tm
(is $160. A new patient exam with x-rays is $285. The dentist confirms the fee.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 541 Tm
(Are you open on Saturday? Yes, from 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m., by appointment. Sunday is) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 526 Tm
(closed.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 505 Tm
(What if I have a toothache after hours? Call \(905\) 555-0148 and follow the message. Go to) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 490 Tm
(the emergency department for swelling, trouble breathing, bleeding that will not slow, or) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 475 Tm
(a face injury.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 454 Tm
(Where do I park? In the free lot behind 185 Central Parkway West. Use the level door that) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 439 Tm
(faces the lot.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 418 Tm
(Which dentist sees children? Dr. Amrit Bhandal. A parent stays for the exam.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 397 Tm
(Which dentist sees implants? Dr. Sarah Chen. The consultation has no fee. Treatment is) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 382 Tm
(quoted after the exam.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 361 Tm
(Do you offer payment plans? No. Payment is due at the visit by debit, Visa, Mastercard, or) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 346 Tm
(cash. A written estimate can be prepared for larger treatment.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 325 Tm
(How early should I arrive? New patients should arrive 15 minutes early. Returning patients) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 310 Tm
(only need a few minutes. More than 15 minutes late may mean the visit is rebooked.) Tj
